Interpretation guide:
  consistency < n      → LLM-only routing would be nondeterministic;
                         rules must stay as the routing layer (hybrid).
  recall gain > 0      → LLM adds real coverage → hybrid is justified
                         as 'LLM proposes, rules/schema validate'.
  validated_extra      → extras that earned routing authority via rules.
  unverified_extra     → extras that must NOT route (false-positive risk).
  hallucinations > 0   → unvalidated LLM detection would trigger
                         unnecessary re-runs and inflate cost.
